<title>USA: St Paul cattle trade steady/firm - USDA.</title>
<headline>St Paul cattle trade steady/firm - USDA.</headline>
<dateline>ST PAUL 1997-06-12</dateline>
<text>
<p>Compared to Wednesday, slaughter steers and heifers sold steady to firm. - USDA</p>
<p>Slaughter Steers: Choice 2-4 1100-1475 lbs 61.00-62.85, few to 63.75. Few Select and Choice 2-3 1000-1200 lbs 59.80-60.40.</p>
<p>Slaughter Heifers: Choice 2-4 1050-1375 lbs 60.00-62.40. Few Select and Choice 2-3 1050-1500 lbs 57.25-60.00.</p>
</text>
